  "prefLabel": "En 1018.02 Commissioning Test",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1018.02 Commissioning Test. The applicant shall conduct the commissioning test pursuant to the IEEE Std 1547™-2018, “IEEE Standard for Interconnection and Interoperability of Distributed Energy Resources with Associated Electric Power Systems Interfaces” dated 4/6/2018 as available in Appendix B, and comply with all manufacturer requirements when conducting the commissioning test.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
